IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. BLIMCLI.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-OP PIC X(20).
01 WS-A PIC X(24).
01 WS-B PIC X(20).
01 WS-C PIC X(20).
01 WS-D PIC X(20).
01 WS-E PIC X(20).
01 WS-AMT PIC S9(15)V99 COMP-3.
01 WS-LIMIT-ED PIC -(15)9.99.
01 WS-USED-ED PIC -(15)9.99.
01 WS-AVAIL-ED PIC -(15)9.99.
COPY "BLIMP".

LINKAGE SECTION.
01 WS-LINE PIC X(1000).

PROCEDURE DIVISION USING WS-LINE.
    PERFORM PARSE-LINE
    MOVE WS-A TO LIM-SCOPE
    MOVE WS-B TO LIM-KEY
    MOVE WS-C TO LIM-PERIOD
    MOVE 0 TO WS-AMT
    IF WS-D NOT = SPACES
        MOVE WS-D TO WS-AMT
    END-IF
    MOVE WS-AMT TO LIM-AMOUNT
    MOVE WS-E TO LIM-CURRENCY
    EVALUATE WS-OP
        WHEN "check" MOVE "CHECK" TO LIM-OP
        WHEN "consume" MOVE "CONSUME" TO LIM-OP
        WHEN "usage" MOVE "CHECK" TO LIM-OP
        WHEN OTHER MOVE SPACES TO LIM-OP
    END-EVALUATE
    IF LIM-OP = SPACES
        DISPLAY "rc=20"
        DISPLAY "msg=UNKNOWN LIMIT OP"
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    CALL "BLIM" USING BK-LIM-REQ
    DISPLAY "rc=" LIM-RC
    MOVE LIM-LIMIT TO WS-LIMIT-ED
    MOVE LIM-USED TO WS-USED-ED
    MOVE LIM-AVAILABLE TO WS-AVAIL-ED
    DISPLAY "limit=" WS-LIMIT-ED
    DISPLAY "used=" WS-USED-ED
    DISPLAY "available=" WS-AVAIL-ED
    DISPLAY "msg=" FUNCTION TRIM(LIM-MSG)
    GOBACK.

PARSE-LINE.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-OP WS-A WS-B WS-C WS-D WS-E
    UNSTRING WS-LINE DELIMITED BY "|"
        INTO WS-OP WS-A WS-B WS-C WS-D WS-E
    END-UNSTRING.
